              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndababgire ukuri: Mur’ aba bahagaze hano harimwo bamwe batazobona urupfu gushitsa aho bazobonera Umwana w’umuntu aje mu bgami bgiwe.",
